  "operative_text": "SECTION 1 (HRS 134-2(j)): Whenever the department of public safety receives notice that an applicant has been denied a permit because of a prior criminal conviction, the department shall determine whether the applicant is currently serving a term of probation or parole and, if the applicant is serving such a term, send notice of the denial to the applicant's probation or parole officer."
